ultiple orange yellow  lobulated areas measuring 0 7cm in greatest diameter  to 0 2cm in diameter  The remaining breast parenchyma consists of approximately 80  pink tan tissue with focal areas of grittiness  which focally abuts the posterior resection margin  Multiple cystic spaces  measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 1cm  with smooth  pink tan lining are located in the mid medial anterior portion of the specimen  and come to REMOVED_DATE of the nearest anterior resection margin  No discrete masses are found  SECTION CODE  A  mid anterior margin  B  lateral anterior margin  C E  medial anterior margin  F  mid posterior margin  G  representative section through cystic space  medial section of specimen  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  sentinel nodes  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm aggregate of tan yellow  fibroadipose tissue  The fatty tissue is dissected to reveal five  pink tan  irregular  ovoid shaped lymph nodes  ranging from REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm  SECTION CODE  H  five individual ovoid shaped soft tissue  I  remaining specimen submitted entirely  Resident  WEI LIEN WANG  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Kevin Hughes MD PART A  LYMPH NODE  RIGHT  SENTINEL    EXCISION PART B  BREAST  RIGHT   RE EXCISION , Unchecked.
