led to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  14 REMOVED_MONTH 96 at 08 56     RECEPTOR IMMUNOHISTOCHEMISTRY Addendum     THIS ADDENDUM HAS BEEN DELETED FOR THIS REPORT GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  Right breast  is a right total mastectomy specimen measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm with an attached irregularly shaped fragment of skin measuring in maximum dimension REMOVED_DATE x 4 2cm  A grossly unremarkable nipple is present on the skin  Sectioning reveals a white firm area measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm  The lesion grossly approaches the deep resection margin to 0 4cm and the inferior margin which is the closest resection margin to less than 0 1cm  Section Code  A B  lesion and inferior margin  C D  lesion and deep margin  E  lesion with overlying skin  F K  representative sections of the lesion  Resident  ALEXANDER KRATZ  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  W B Jerry Younger  M D  PART   RIGHT SIMPLE MASTECTOMY   report_end  , Unchecked.
