ction margin  The biopsy cavity is surrounded by an irregular  firm  focally yellow colored tissue and an ill defined  firm  white to tan tissue that extends to the superior  lateral  inferior  and focally to the deep soft tissue resection margins  The remaining breast parenchyma is composed of soft  lobulated adipose tissue  Section code  A  skin with scar and biopsy cavity  with closest lateral and medial soft tissue resection margin B  biopsy cavity and medial resection margin C  biopsy cavity and lateral resection margin D  biopsy cavity with superior resection margin E  inferior resection margin F  deep resection margin  firm  white area  G H  biopsy cavity with lateral resection margin  representative sections  including firm white area I  firm white area  representative sections  inferior margin J  firm white area  representative section  lateral margin Also in the specimen container  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm portion of fibroadipose tissue  The specimen is inked and sectioned to reveal an ill defined  white  firm breast tissue that approaches the inked margins  and is interposed with yellow  lobulated adipose tissue  Representative sections are submitted in K through N  Resident  STAMATINA KAPTAIN  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Edwin Lee Carter  M D  PART   RE EXCISION OF RIGHT BREAST   report_end  , Unchecked.
